[14.867575, "o", "Usage: tigris [options] [command]\r\n\r\nCommand line interface for Tigris\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  -V, --version                   output the version number\r\n  -h, --help                      display help for command\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  configure|c [options]           Save access-key credentials to\r\n                                  ~/.tigris/config.json for persistent use\r\n                                  across all commands\r\n  login|l [options]               Start a session via OAuth (default) or\r\n                                  temporary credentials. Session state is\r\n                                  cleared on logout\r\n  whoami|w [options]              Print the currently authenticated user,\r\n                                  organization, and auth method\r\n  update [options]                Update the CLI to the latest version\r\n  logout [options]                End the current session and clear login state.\r\n                                  Credentials saved via 'configure' are kept\r\n  credentials|creds               Test whether your current credentials can\r\n                                  reach Tigris and optionally verify access to a\r\n                                  specific bucket\r\n  ls|list [options] [path]        List all buckets (no arguments) or objects\r\n                                  under a bucket/prefix path. Accepts bare names\r\n                                  or t3:// URIs\r\n  mk|create [options] <path>      Create a bucket (bare name) or a folder inside\r\n                                  a bucket (bucket/folder/ with trailing slash)\r\n  touch [options] <path>          Create an empty (zero-byte) object at the\r\n                                  given bucket/key path\r\n"]
