[101.081019, "o", "Usage: tigris snapshots|s [options] [command]\r\n\r\nList and take snapshots. A snapshot is a point-in-time, read-only copy of a bucket's state\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  -h, --help                               display help for command\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  list|l [options] <name>                  List all snapshots for the given bucket, ordered by creation time\r\n  take|t [options] <name> [snapshot-name]  Take a new snapshot of the bucket's current state. Optionally provide a name for the snapshot\r\n  help                                     Show help for this command\r\n"]
